# Base URL of the backend API.
#
# Leave this empty for the merged single-application setup: the ASP.NET Core
# backend serves the built SPA and the API on the same origin. During
# `npm run dev`, `/api` requests are proxied to the backend (see vite.config.ts).
#
# Only set this if you host the API on a different origin.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://localhost:7252
